  abilityId: 850858
  abilityName: Last Deterrent
  abilityDesc: 8 combo Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    may raise allies from KO, fills BB gauge for 3 turns, restores HP for 3 turns,
    removes all status ailments and Atk, Def, Rec reduction & probable KO resistance
